WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.301
-As I said,
today is Thanksgiving.

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.669
It's a day that --
all about giving thanks,

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:05.238
so I thought, what better day
to write up my weekly

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.439
Thank You Notes?

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.740
Do you guys mind?

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.209
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.944
James, can I get some
Thank You Note writing music,

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.246
please?

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.814
♪♪

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.982
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.017
Look. He's eating something.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:21.354
-He's eating leftovers.
-Yeah.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.256
It's a turkey leg.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.825
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.461
Thank you, gravy boats,
for looking like

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.164
I'm about to summon a genie
with high cholesterol.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.900
[ Applause ]

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:38.938
♪♪

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.540
Thank you, turkey,

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.176
or as I like to call you,
savory Ambien.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.178
[ Applause ]

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.449
♪♪

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.352
Thank you, pecan pie,

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.754
for always starting
a spirited Thanksgiving argument

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.056
about how to properly
pronounce your name.

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:58.758
"It's pih-CON."

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.260
[ Applause ]

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.296
"It's pih-CAN pie-EE."

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.165
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.566
♪♪

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:10.470
Thank you, adding a leaf
to the dining table,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.238
for making sure
I'm not the only thing

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.706
getting wider on Thanksgiving.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.275
Yeah.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.743
[ Applause ]

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.282
♪♪

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:25.818
Thank you, person who brings
salad to Thanksgiving dinner.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:27.554
We aren't gonna say
anything to your face,

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.488
but you best believe
you're getting dragged

00:01:29.488 --> 00:01:31.824
in the group chat as we speak.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.393
"Salad?"

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.628
[ Applause ]

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:36.696
-"Are you kidding?"

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.465
-"You gotta be kidding."

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.602
♪♪

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.437
Thank you, squash,

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.639
for looking like a pumpkin
that's sucking in its gut

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.974
for a selfie.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.375
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.810
[ Applause ]

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.515
♪♪

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:59.218
Thank you, Black Friday sales,

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:01.954
or as I like to call you,
"The Purge: Walmart Edition."

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.057
There you have it, everybody.
Those are my Thank You Notes.

